      "text": "Functional Requirements:\n\n- Create profile with preferences (age_range,\ninterested_in) & max_distance\n- Feed with recommended profiles that match filter\ncriteria\n- Swipe \"Yes\" | \"No\" for a profile\n- Both users swiped \"Yes\", both are notified",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "Q2iGJFPYvGamiXiAIySnL",
      "originalText": "Functional Requirements:\n\n- Create profile with preferences (age_range, interested_in) & max_distance\n- Feed with recommended profiles that match filter criteria\n- Swipe \"Yes\" | \"No\" for a profile\n- Both users swiped \"Yes\", both are notified",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
