      "text": "Non Functional Requirements:\n\n- C >> A, for swipes\n- Many concurrent users with unpredictable peaks in\ntraffic(20M users ~100 swipes/day/user)\n- Low latency feed fetching (<300ms)\n- No repeated profiles",
